      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ballet Kelowna is the Interior of BC’s only professional dance company, known for its bold performances and commitment to developing Canadian talent. Under Artistic Director Simone Orlando, the company tours widely and delivers award-winning programming and outreach across the region."
