    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This production is performed and presented by the Broadway North Youth Company's Intermediate Class (ages 9 to 11). Middle schoolers face a tornado of questions every day. What do I wear? What if I wear the wrong thing? What is she wearing? What do I look like? Stop looking at me!"
