      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Here is Rydell High’s senior class of 1959: duck-tailed, hot-rodding “Burger Palace Boys’ and their gum-snapping, hip-shaking “Pink Ladies” in bobby sox and pedal pushers, evoking the look and sound of the 1950s in this rollicking musical."
