        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ballet Jörgen is Canada’s leading touring ballet company, bringing vibrant, full-length productions and contemporary works to audiences from coast to coast. Known for its warmth, beauty, and distinct Canadian voice, the company makes ballet accessible and relevant for today’s audiences."
